This repository is glue. It does not vendor CAD engine source. At runtime it
clones or installs third-party tools into isolated environments and runs their
published command-line interfaces.

Third-party software the user installs (not shipped as source in this tree)
===========================================================================

scad123d / scad2step
  https://github.com/etjones/scad123d
  https://github.com/etjones/scad2step
  License: MIT
  Used as: `uv run scad2step`

draftwright
  https://github.com/pzfreo/draftwright
  License: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0
  Used as: `uv run draftwright` (V1) or `uv run python scripts/v2_draw_worker.py`
  inside the draftwright environment (V2). The worker may import draftwright
  in that process only. This wrapper does not copy, modify, or relicense
  draftwright. If you modify draftwright or expose a modified copy as a
  network service, AGPL obligations are yours.

build123d
  https://github.com/gumyr/build123d
  License: Apache-2.0
  Transitive dependency of the two environments above.

OpenSCAD
  https://openscad.org
  License: GPL-2.0-or-later
  Installed as a system binary (apt, AppImage, etc.). Not linked.

BOSL2 (optional, only if a model `include`s it)
  https://github.com/BelfrySCAD/BOSL2
  License: BSD-2-Clause
  Cloned into the OpenSCAD libraries directory; not imported as Python.

Do not copy maowiz/step2pdf code into this project (no published license).
